# Professional UI Design Rules - Beautiful by Default

## 🔴 MANDATORY - EVERY PAGE MUST HAVE
Check FIRST before any UI code:

✅ **CLEAN IMPORTS** - Only valid, used imports (see import-management.mdc)
✅ Header with Joveo logo & navigate to homepage (top-left) import JoveoLogoIcon from "./JoveoLogoIcon";
✅ Footer with company info  
✅ Professional gradient backgrounds (NEVER plain white/gray)
✅ All interactive elements have hover effects and smooth transitions
✅ Empty, loading, error, success states with beautiful styling
✅ Typography variants with proper visual hierarchy
✅ Professional color schemes with gradients

## 🚨 CRITICAL: SAMPLE CONTENT CLEANUP FIRST
Before generating ANY component:
0. **CLEAN** all sample/demo content from src/app/page.tsx (see sample-content-cleanup.mdc)
1. **READ** /.cursor/project-context.md for domain and user type
2. **APPLY** context-aware component variants (see context-aware-components.mdc)
3. **VERIFY** all imported components exist
4. **INSTALL** missing shadcn dependencies if needed  
5. **REMOVE** any unused imports
6. **ORGANIZE** imports properly (React → libraries → UI → icons → utils)
7. **UPDATE** /.cursor/project-context.md with successful patterns

## 🚨 CRITICAL: AUTO-ENHANCE ALL BASIC REQUESTS
When ANY user asks for basic components, AUTOMATICALLY generate the beautiful version:
- "Create a button" → Generate gradient button with hover animations
- "Build a dashboard" → Generate full analytics dashboard with glassmorphic cards
- "Make a form" → Generate form with validation animations and gradient styling
- "Add a table" → Generate ReUI Data Grid with advanced features and beautiful styling

**NEVER ask for clarification on styling - beautiful is the ONLY option.**

## ❌ INSTANT VIOLATIONS - NEVER ALLOW
```tsx
// ❌ WRONG - Plain, lifeless design
<div className="bg-white">
  <h1 style={{ fontSize: '24px' }}>Title</h1> // Raw styles
  <p style={{ color: '#333' }}>Text</p> // Hex colors
  <button className="bg-blue-500">Click me</button> // No hover effects
</div>

// ✅ CORRECT - Professional, beautiful structure  
<div className="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-blue-50">
  <header className="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-slate-200/50 px-4 py-4 shadow-sm">
    <div className="flex items-center justify-between">
      <JoveoLogoIcon />
      <nav className="flex items-center space-x-6">
        {/* Navigation with hover effects */}
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  
  <main className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-6">
    <Typography variant="h1" className="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-800 to-slate-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
      Beautiful Title
    </Typography>
    <Typography variant="body1Medium" className="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Professional content with proper styling
    </Typography>
  </main>
  
  <footer className="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-50 to-slate-100 border-t border-slate-200/50 px-4 py-6 mt-auto">
    <Typography variant="captionRegular" className="text-slate-500">
      © 2025 Joveo. All rights reserved.
    </Typography>
  </footer>
</div>
```
## 📋 REQUIRED BEAUTIFUL COMPONENTS

```tsx
// Professional Empty State
const EmptyState = ({ title, description, action }) => (
  <div className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12 text-center">
    <div className="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-100 to-slate-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-lg">
      <InboxIcon className="w-8 h-8 text-slate-400" />
    </div>
    <Typography variant="subtitle1SemiBold" className="text-slate-900 mb-2">{title}</Typography>
    <Typography variant="body2Regular" className="text-slate-600 mb-6 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
      {description}
    </Typography>
    {action && (
      <Button className="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-white hover:from-blue-700 hover:to-indigo-700 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:scale-105">
        {action}
      </Button>
    )}
  </div>
);

// Beautiful Loading State
const LoadingState = () => (
  <div className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12">
    <div className="relative">
      <div className="animate-spin rounded-full h-10 w-10 border-4 border-slate-200 border-t-blue-600 shadow-lg"></div>
      <div className="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-indigo-500 opacity-20 animate-pulse"></div>
    </div>
    <Typography variant="body2Regular" className="text-slate-600 mt-4 animate-pulse">
      Loading your content...
    </Typography>
  </div>
);

// Professional Error State
const ErrorState = ({ title, description, onRetry }) => (
  <div className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12 text-center">
    <div className="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-red-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-lg">
      <AlertTriangleIcon className="w-8 h-8 text-white" />
    </div>
    <Typography variant="subtitle1SemiBold" className="text-slate-900 mb-2">{title}</Typography>
    <Typography variant="body2Regular" className="text-slate-600 mb-6 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
      {description}
    </Typography>
    {onRetry && (
      <Button 
        onClick={onRetry} 
        className="bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 to-red-700 text-white hover:from-red-700 hover:to-red-800 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl"
      >
        <RefreshCwIcon className="w-4 h-4 mr-2" />
        Try Again
      </Button>
    )}
  </div>
);

// Success State
const SuccessState = ({ title, description, action }) => (
  <div className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12 text-center">
    <div className="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-lg">
      <CheckCircleIcon className="w-8 h-8 text-white" />
    </div>
    <Typography variant="subtitle1SemiBold" className="text-slate-900 mb-2">{title}</Typography>
    <Typography variant="body2Regular" className="text-slate-600 mb-6 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
      {description}
    </Typography>
    {action}
  </div>
);
```
